{"text": "November 29, 2017\n\nDear Friend,\n\nI write to explain that the Oklahoma Speaker's Ball for 2018 is cancelled. Due to the time demands on\nlegislators required by the recent special session of the Legislature and the uncertainty with respect to time\nissues of the anticipated second special session, the Speaker's Ball, which was scheduled for January 27,2018,\nwill not occur. The business of the special sessions must take precedence, of course.\n\nWe regret any inconvenience the cancellation may cause, If you have already sent a check for the 2018 Ball,\nyou will receive a full refund.\n\nWe have very much appreciated your support of previous Speaker's Balls. Over the past 11 years, the\nSpeaker's Ball has contributed over $250,000 to various charities in our state. We are pleased to announce\nthat we can afford to make a contribution of $25,000 to Folds of Honor, the charity selected for the 2018 Ball,\n\nWe will be back next year! Please preserve a spot in your budget to support the Speaker\u2019s Ball for 2019.\n\nSincerely,\n\nMhur /\" \u00e9hiff\n\nRobert McCampbell, Chairman\nOklahoma Speaker's Ball, Inc.",
